  "body": "Node.js behaves a bit differently for `console.assert()` as specified [in the docs](https://nodejs.org/dist/latest-v7.x/docs/api/console.html#console_console_assert_value_message_args):\r\n\r\nThere is even this note: `Note: the console.assert() method is implemented differently in Node.js than the console.assert() method available in browsers.`.\r\n\r\n_Note: `console.assert()` was added in Node v0.1.101. Changing it may be difficult._",
